  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(8)': Endor Operations, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform, Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order and You Cannot Hide Forever; total 60 as published. Several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Posted 'Endor Operations/Big Blue Base' dested Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost; 'Big Blue(12)' is a section header (capital starships), not a card.",
  "Posted line 'Something Special Planned For Them Perimeter Patrol' is two cards run together (the Effects(12) count and the strategy's 'pull out Perimeter Patrol' need both): dested Something Special Planned For Them and Perimeter Patrol.",
  "Posted 'What Are You Trying To Push On Us?' is the Light Effect What're You Tryin' To Push On Us?; no Dark card of that name exists, so it is kept as posted and marked UNKNOWN.",
  "Secret Plans and Oppressive Enforcement are the Special Edition Effects (not Defensive Shields in January 2001).",
  "Posted 'Captain Gilead Pellaeon' dested Captain Gilad Pellaeon; 'Zuckass in Mist Hunter' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'Dreadnaught Heavy Class Cruiser' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'U-3PO' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Ghhhk & TRWEU' Ghhhk & Those Rebels Won't Escape Us; 'Twilek Advisor' Twi'lek Advisor.",
